    "detailed_description": "You like Chess? <br>You like cute, cube-shaped animals?? <br>Well, look no further!<br><br>This project was inspired by Oats Jenkins' video on Youtube titled &quot;I Made a BETTER Chess&quot;. In their video, they revised the pieces and rules.<br>This project is that idea, turned into a video game.<br><br><strong><u>FEATURES</u></strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Themed animal aesthetic<br></li><li>Revised pieces with new moves<br></li><li>New win condition (Jail squares)<br></li><li>New Piece: The Bear (can be controlled by both players)<br></li><li>In-Game guide to explain pieces &amp; new rule changes<br></li><li>Multiplayer only (local &amp; online)</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Piece Customization &amp; Unlockable Hats!</li></ul>",
